 you're getting value then  we'll keep doing it and if you say Evan  this sucks you suck never do this again  if that's the collective opinion then  then I'll stop so listen guys it's been  an hour it's been a ton of fun  I really appreciate spending time with  you hopefully you got some questions  answered and you know I want to  encourage you to just put more  importance on what you're doing today  that today matters that you could do  something really important today there's  still a huge chunk of time left on the  day and not just coasts not just slack  off not just you know say okay well you  know the day's almost over like what you  can do today really matters I want you  to make something today that your  grandkids will be proud of like whatever  you're making today you want to show  your grandkids again if you take that  approach every day the stuff you will  make will be insane so thank you guys  for the love I believe in you I hope we  continue to build  in yourself and whatever your one where  it is much love guys have a great day  I'll see you soon
 

